# Frontend Standards

## Technology

- React.
- TypeScript.
- Vite.
- Tailwind CSS.
- TanStack Query.
- Shadcn UI for standard controls. Layout, empty and loading states, and status treatment can stay custom when a Shadcn component does not fit.

## Architecture

Organize code by features.

Use:
- components/: reusable UI components.
- features/: feature-specific modules.
- hooks/: reusable hooks.
- layouts/: application layouts.
- lib/: shared utilities.
- services/: API clients.
- types/: shared TypeScript types.

## Coding Standards

- Prefer functional components.
- Use strict TypeScript.
- Avoid unnecessary any types.
- Keep components focused.
- Separate API communication from UI components.
- Reuse common components.
- Handle loading, error, and empty states.

## UI Direction

Build a professional cybersecurity SaaS interface.

Design characteristics:
- Dark-first interface.
- Clean information hierarchy.
- Professional dashboard layout.
- Clear severity indicators.
- Responsive design.
- Consistent spacing and typography.

Avoid excessive gradients, unnecessary animations,
and decorative elements that reduce readability.